  "excerpt": "The bazaar is not an art project, and this paper holds no prompt tricks. The bazaar is this site's index: a pixel-art night market, ten stalls, one route per stall, a talking keeper in each. gpt-image-class models generated every pixel. Codex CLI drove the jobs, Claude supervised the fleets, and I directed by eye. This paper is the engineering method.",
